sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Cu as Customer
  participant F as Fulfillment
  participant CR as Courier
  participant K as Kafka
  participant Co as Commerce
  participant P as Payment
  participant PSP as Payment provider
  Cu->>F: POST /returns (order item, reason, photos)
  F->>F: delivered? inside return window? category returnable?
  F--)K: ReturnRequested
  F->>CR: book reverse pickup
  CR->>F: webhook picked up
  F--)K: ReturnPickedUp
  CR->>F: webhook delivered to seller
  F->>F: seller marks resellable or not
  F--)K: ReturnReceived
  K--)Co: restock if resellable, stock movement RESTOCK
  K--)P: ReturnReceived
  P->>PSP: refund to original method
  PSP-->>P: refund done
  P->>P: refund COMPLETED, reversing ledger entries
  P--)K: RefundCompleted
